{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07337","headline":"夕次檐石湖梦洛阳亲故 · 刘长卿","name":"夕次檐石湖梦洛阳亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天涯望不尽，日暮愁独去。\n万里云海空，孤帆向何处。\n寄身烟波里，颇得湖山趣。\n江气和楚云，秋声乱枫树。\n如何异乡县，日复怀亲故。\n遥与洛阳人，相逢梦中路。\n不堪明月里，更值清秋暮。\n倚棹对沧波，归心共谁语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}